This is my second ascension and like my first it is a wizard.
After my first I wanted to do it properly, it felt like the first was just a
test run. This time around I had a bit more control and knew what to expect.
This time I took notes from the start so I have more material for the YAAP
but I'll try to keep it brief (not that I will succeed)

