Dlvl 5 was a hearse bone level from a wizard name Alexis. Haeldil adopted
the pets. Uncursed some stuff and got AC down to -1. This is going the right
way...
Dlvl 8 was the Oracle, Eveh and Alexis' kitten died there.
Haeldil was almost killed by a leocrotta by the stairs to sokoban.
Sokoban was easy and the prize was a BoH. Set up a stash on the bottom of
