polymorph! Haeldil was now a female disenchanter and had no longer armor or
CoMR and lost the polyself conduct (seems the RNG don't want me to keep it).
On dlvl 5 Haeldil put on Alexis' cursed CoMR and cast remove curse until he
got it right (84% fail).
Mines next... The town is bustling version. It turns out it is a double
bones of 2 incarnation of Jafar the wizard (one was killed by a bat). The
tempel is neutral and Izchak only has 4 candles. Got 3 points of protection
from the priest.
Then the second near death experience: Haeldil got engulfed by an energy
vortex and had 1 HP left when he killed it.
Took over Jafar's stash in the temple containing =oSD, =oFS, another BoH and
two magic lamps.
Mines end was the Wine cellar version. Found the luckstone and yet another
