He then took most stuff with him to sokoban.
Dlvl 11 has a chaotic temple where he donated all his gold and offered until
he got Magicbane.
Dlvl 13 has the quest portal but Haeldil wasn't ready just yet.
Explored down to dlvl 21 before he got burdened and decided to head back up
